(7732231, 1273931, 173844, '<td valign="top">So impressively head-on.  So poised for take-off, like on the deck of an aircraft carrier.  The eyes are so intense that all else fades off to a blur.  Swaddled in a dream.<br/>One of three personal favorites in the challenge.</td>', 'So impressively head-on.  So poised for take-off, like on the deck of an aircraft carrier.  The eyes are so intense that all else fades off to a blur.  Swaddled in a dream.One of three personal favorites in the challenge.', '2022-11-07 21:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7732232, 1274046, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice title.  And all we can do now is let the geese make it good again.  Wonderful parade, and so effective in this perspective.  Black and white seems the way to go, enhancing the drama.  The moody, befogged background maintains focus on the foreground.  Surprising and wonderful.<br/>One of three personal favorites in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice title.  And all we can do now is let the geese make it good again.  Wonderful parade, and so effective in this perspective.  Black and white seems the way to go, enhancing the drama.  The moody, befogged background maintains focus on the foreground.  Surprising and wonderful.One of three personal favorites in the challenge.', '2022-11-07 21:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7732234, 1274031, 173844, '<td valign="top">Your title, and henceforth the image, is multi-faceted and spectral.  What''s going on, are these human forms real, is this the way to the afterlife?  Haunting, and somewhat frightening.  Nice use of the fragmenting overlay.  Powerful.<br/>One of three personal favorites in the challenge.</td>', 'Your title, and henceforth the image, is multi-faceted and spectral.  What''s going on, are these human forms real, is this the way to the afterlife?  Haunting, and somewhat frightening.  Nice use of the fragmenting overlay.  Powerful.One of three personal favorites in the challenge.', '2022-11-07 21:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7732236, 1273977, 173844, '<td valign="top">At odds with my personal preference for no sign of humanity in landscapes, the road kind of works here as it echoes the terrain.  The fog, or low clouds, spilling through the valleys is lovely to gaze upon.  Great depth, eventually fading into the subtle sky.  Heartening atmosphere.  Fine stuff.</td>', 'At odds with my personal preference for no sign of humanity in landscapes, the road kind of works here as it echoes the terrain.  The fog, or low clouds, spilling through the valleys is lovely to gaze upon.  Great depth, eventually fading into the subtle sky.  Heartening atmosphere.  Fine stuff.', '2022-11-07 22:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7732237, 1273936, 114285, '<td valign="top">Going back commenting on images Ive already voted on. This is really a neat shot, pity the colours are a little bit flat, in the sky and the water. Nevertheless amazing capture.<br/> <br/>LevT?? I think so.</td>', 'Going back commenting on images Ive already voted on. This is really a neat shot, pity the colours are a little bit flat, in the sky and the water. Nevertheless amazing capture. LevT?? I think so.', '2022-11-07 22:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7732238, 1274055, 114285, '<td valign="top">Going back commenting on images Ive already voted on. What a sight to behold, Im sure viewing it wouldve taken your breath away. The toning seems a little bit unnatural though. Nevertheless very pretty.</td>', 'Going back commenting on images Ive already voted on. What a sight to behold, Im sure viewing it wouldve taken your breath away. The toning seems a little bit unnatural though. Nevertheless very pretty.', '2022-11-07 22:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
