(7732241, 1274041, 173844, '<td valign="top">The casual, bright photographer thrives in the corner.  We see the view partly through his eyes, more so than in a straightforward landscape.  And it''s gorgeous, awe inspiring.<br/>Imagine, we can just go and see this.  Handsome work.</td>', 'The casual, bright photographer thrives in the corner.  We see the view partly through his eyes, more so than in a straightforward landscape.  And it''s gorgeous, awe inspiring.Imagine, we can just go and see this.  Handsome work.', '2022-11-07 22:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
