(7732245, 1273974, 173844, '<td valign="top">See under "B," for beautiful.  To appreciate our everyday world gives life depth and satisfaction.  For example...  Lovely colors, maybe doodled with, but strutting their stuff in silent majesty.  And just so without the leaves, simply branches.  And so on.</td>', 'See under "B," for beautiful.  To appreciate our everyday world gives life depth and satisfaction.  For example...  Lovely colors, maybe doodled with, but strutting their stuff in silent majesty.  And just so without the leaves, simply branches.  And so on.', '2022-11-07 22:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7732246, 1273933, 75585, '<td valign="top">I like this, it is nice, I feel like its missing something to draw me in . . . Sun setting in the O, a couple kissing, etc.  That said, it is nice.</td>', 'I like this, it is nice, I feel like its missing something to draw me in . . . Sun setting in the O, a couple kissing, etc.  That said, it is nice.', '2022-11-07 22:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7732247, 1274042, 75585, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo but there are multiple areas that could hold your attention that just dont because of the composition.  Perhaps a shallower depth of field with focus on the shack and no gray dead trees which dont really say autumn to me.  A lot of potential - 6</td>', 'This is a nice photo but there are multiple areas that could hold your attention that just dont because of the composition.  Perhaps a shallower depth of field with focus on the shack and no gray dead trees which dont really say autumn to me.  A lot of potential - 6', '2022-11-07 22:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
